OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sat 28 Nov to Sat 12 Dec
OL,6,FLow pressure is signalled become slow
OL,7,Fmoving to the west then south of the
OL,8,FUK, whilst pressure builds to the
OL,9,Fnorth of the country. Further rain is
OL,10,Fprobable across southern and perhaps
OL,11,Fcentral areas, but below average
OL,12,Fprecipitation could occur in parts of
OL,13,Fthe north, especially the northwest.
OL,14,FWith a blocked weather pattern
OL,15,Fsignalled to develop, this increases
OL,16,Fthe chance of colder conditions
OL,17,Foverall, with associated winter
OL,18,Fhazards, e.g. snow and ice, occurring;
OL,19,Fthis most likely further to the north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
